g:m017-0355","start":355,"end":357,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002837","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m017-0413","start":413,"end":415,"surface":"有司","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m017-0451","start":451,"end":453,"surface":"齊侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002837","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-047-kong","book_id":"b-shiji-047","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-047-kong"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:p018","text":"定公十三年夏，孔子言於定公曰：「臣無藏甲，大夫毋百雉之城。」使仲由為季氏宰，將墮三都。於是叔孫氏先墮郈。季氏將墮費，公山不狃、叔孫輒率費人襲魯。公與三子入于季氏之宮，登武子之臺。費人攻之，弗克，入及公側。孔子命申句須、樂頎下伐之，費人北。國人追之，敗諸姑蔑。二子奔齊，遂墮費。將墮成，公歛處父謂孟孫曰：「墮成，齊人必至于北門。且成，孟氏之保鄣，無成是無孟氏也。我將弗墮。」十二月，公圍成，弗克。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002842","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002842","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"仲由","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002864","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"叔孫氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong:m018-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"季氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"宗族、群體、神怪、官稱或說話對象未定，不補成員姓名及親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-047-kong